> Hi all,
>
> Just a quick update on the questions detailed above. Version 2.0.3 of camtrapR has some issues with recordTable() recognizing videos in subdirectories and their corresponding tags. Juergen has this problem corrected in his dev version, so recordTable() should work as normal with videos in subdirectories once the package is updated on CRAN.
>
> Best,
> Wes
>
