H Raquel,
what's the problem, and what did you try? Did you run exifTagNames on one of the avi files to check the metadata are ok, and to confirm there's a correct date/time tag?

It may not work if mixing data from multiple cameras in one folder if for example the date/time tag that is present in the mov files is not present in the avi files (or the manufacturer decided to save it in a different tag).

Best,
Jürgen

